	Z^{r_\xpt}(u_\xpt) X^{r_\zpt}(u_\zpt) \otimes \Id_\bob \approx_\eps \Id_\alice \otimes M^{\Variable_5,\omega}  M^{\Variable_1,\omega}\;.
