X^{r_\xpt}(u_\xpt) Z^{r_\zpt}(u_\zpt) \otimes \Id_\bob \approx_{\sqrt{\eps}} - Z^{r_\zpt}(u_\zpt)X^{r_\xpt}(u_\xpt)  \otimes \Id_\bob\;.
